10_6877594147168239640_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=99LXKdYVAiAQ7kNvwGoAVHA&_nc_oc=AdrrSAH4A1OlabGhKyx43WoeH_ndkLTW0PZQCrIMgsNSzTHbi4fzhSSpv9FTq-ImQ-E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5qgdJ0yq4GolFxKZqLhGVNDVU5RFNQG9IwALhhyN3SOQ&oe=6A20394C"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "2953570888277783", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392093_2953570891611116_6048066563426032845_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8n6CB2X0-ywQ7kNvwG2vCyK&_nc_oc=AdpaXo47lrqwD9TP46VP6jf2EnbIQDzO2Rmkp60q8mNm61yoFbasAE2sDa9YEBHmjPs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af74emEyrNZLNblZC4hb6bgAlEiKO2HAEHeKp6cES22WtQ&oe=6A204A3C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "The Finders_Cover Landscape.png", "id": "1629436301031148", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392069_1629436304364481_4255148496526447739_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Tqei7JPIhdUQ7kNvwFxvPov&_nc_oc=AdoKIentHD1SHt8yTERsbiVt99HBaSnW0WioOfFm0x0UrXD0bdVN2vjacX7dVkkOxfM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4ki3z-NCHJKQyCOFye97dEnW1T4yy8gE8bOE2JJdw3hQ&oe=6A20292B"}, "display_name": "The Finders", "keywords": ["pet", "cat", "finding", "challenge", "finder"], "long_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore maps, complete exciting quests, play various mini-games, hang out with other players (Coming Soon), collect objects, and level up to become the best \"Finder.\"\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbCute animals\n\u30fbSandbox exploration\n\u30fbMain quest \n\u30fbMini-games\n\nMore features will be added every month. So, stay tuned with us!", "short_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore